        "---\n",
        "## 🤖 STEP 5 — Model Training\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** Train the **Linear SVM (LinearSVC)** as the primary model — it achieved the best QWK in the research comparison — alongside OrdinalGB as a reference baseline, using 5-fold Stratified Cross-Validation.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Models trained:**\n",
        "- **LinearSVC (Primary)** — Linear kernel SVM with balanced class weights; best QWK of all evaluated models\n",
        "- **OrdinalGB (Baseline)** — Custom ordinal-aware regressor; optimised for QWK via rounding\n",
        "\n",
        "**Evaluation metric:** Quadratic Weighted Kappa (QWK) — penalises large errors more than small ones\n",
        "\n",
        "> ℹ️ **Why LinearSVC?** In the extended model research (Step 5.1), LinearSVC outperformed RandomForest, LightGBM, XGBoost, and GradientBoosting on QWK. RandomForest and LightGBM showed severe overfitting (training accuracy ~1.0 but near-zero CV QWK). LinearSVC generalised best.\n"
