        "## 📉 STEP 6 — Model Evaluation\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** Evaluate the best model on a 20% held-out test set (data the model never saw during training).\n",
        "\n",
        "**Metrics computed:**\n",
        "- **Accuracy** — percentage of exactly correct predictions\n",
        "- **Quadratic Weighted Kappa (QWK)** — official competition metric; rewards predictions close to truth\n",
        "- **Cohen's Kappa** — accuracy corrected for chance agreement\n",
        "- **Classification Report** — precision, recall, F1 per sii class\n",
        "\n",
        "**3 plots generated:** confusion matrix, feature importance, per-class metrics\n"
      ]
