        "---\n",
        "## 🔮 STEP 7 — Predict for New Children\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** Use the trained model to predict PIU risk for any new child and generate personalised recommendations.\n",
        "\n",
        "**How it works:**\n",
        "1. Enter the child's health metrics as a dictionary\n",
        "2. The model predicts the `sii` class (0–3)\n",
        "3. A **Behavior Score (0–100)** is calculated from lifestyle factors\n",
        "4. **Personalised recommendations** are generated for parents\n",
        "\n",
        "> ✏️ **Try your own data:** Edit the `my_child` dictionary at the bottom of this section!\n"
      ]
    },
