        "## 🔬 STEP 5.1 — Extended Model Research & Comparison (Demonstration)\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** This section serves as a research demonstration to explore a wider variety of machine learning algorithms beyond the initial selection. We will perform hyperparameter tuning for each model to identify the optimal configuration and compare their performance using the Quadratic Weighted Kappa (QWK) metric.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Models Explored:**\n",
        "- **Logistic Regression** (Linear baseline)\n",
        "- **Decision Tree Classifier** (Non-linear baseline)\n",
        "- **Random Forest** (Tuned Ensemble)\n",
        "- **XGBoost** (Tuned Gradient Boosting)\n",
        "- **LightGBM** (Tuned Histogram-based Boosting)\n",
        "- **Support Vector Machine (SVC)** (Kernel-based classifier)\n",
        "- **Gradient Boosting Classifier** (Standard Boosting)\n",
        "- **AdaBoost Classifier** (Ensemble of weak learners)\n",
        "- **Gaussian Naive Bayes** (Probabilistic classifier)"
