        "## Detailed Implementation Plan: Child Behaviour & Mental Health Risk Analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook implements a complete Machine Learning pipeline to analyze child behavior and mental health risks based on the Child Mind Institute's Problematic Internet Use (PIU) dataset. The primary goal is to classify children into different severity levels of PIU (0=Healthy, 1=Mild, 2=Moderate, 3=Severe) and provide personalized recommendations.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1. 📊 Data Understanding (Step 1)\n",
        "\n",
        "This crucial initial step involved loading the raw dataset and gaining a foundational understanding of its structure, content, and quality.\n",
        "\n",
        "*   **Total Rows & Columns (Raw Data)**:\n",
        "    *   **Training Set**: 2,500 rows, 19 columns\n",
        "    *   **Test Set**: 500 rows, 18 columns (target variable `sii` is absent)\n",
        "*   **Feature Information & Types**: The dataset contains various numerical features (`float64`, `int64`) related to demographics (age, sex), physical health (BMI, height, weight, waist, blood pressure, heart rate), sleep disturbance (SDS), fitness (PAQ, endurance), and body composition (BIA). There's also an `object` type for `id` and an `Int64` for the target `sii` (which can contain `pd.NA`).\n",
        "*   **Missing Values**: Significant missingness was observed across several critical features, similar to the real-world dataset:\n",
        "    *   `BIA-BIA_Fat`: 30.4%\n",
        "    *   `Fitness_Endurance-Time_Mins`: 30.0%\n",
        "    *   `SDS-SDS_Total_T`: 29.8%\n",
        "    *   `BIA-BIA_SMM`: 29.8%\n",
        "    *   `BIA-BIA_FFM`: 29.0%\n",
        "    *   `Fitness_Endurance-Max_Stage`: 28.8%\n",
        "    *   `sii` (target variable): 13.1% (these rows were removed as they cannot be used for training)\n",
        "*   **Target Variable (`sii`) Distribution (Raw Data)**:\n",
        "    *   sii=0 (None/Healthy): 31.0%\n",
        "    *   sii=1 (Mild): 21.0%\n",
        "    *   sii=2 (Moderate): 11.7%\n",
        "    *   sii=3 (Severe): 23.3%\n",
        "    *   Missing (`<NA>`): 13.1%\n",
        "\n",
        "**Output Snapshot (First 3 rows of raw training data):**\n"
      ],
      "id": "65d8f523"
    },
