        "    *   **How it works**: A linear Support Vector Machine. It finds a hyperplane that best separates the classes in the feature space. For multi-class classification, `LinearSVC` typically uses a one-vs-rest (OvR) strategy. It aims to maximize the margin between the classes, making it robust to noisy data. The"
